# "Choose one that hasn't been chosen": Bot2 casts five free spells with mana value 0 (four Moxen and Ornithopter) into a Gollum that chose even. The first riddle takes the counter
# and the second drains 2 (both asked), the third has one mode left and takes it without asking (draw a card), and the fourth and fifth do nothing (this implementation has the
# ability not trigger at all once every mode is taken).

